Spec: Android current-caller principal

Purpose:
  Bind application authority to the actual Binder UID, package, signing generation and install identity.

Owns:
  ./CallerPrincipal.java

Must:
  Reject other user profiles, shared UIDs, missing metadata and changing snapshots.
  Capture identity synchronously on the Binder thread and derive scope without request-supplied identity fields.
  Keep caller provenance for owner review and bound concurrent inspection per UID and globally.
  Preserve OS-verified signer rotation using the original signing anchor; reinstall and unrelated signers have distinct scopes.
